  "subtitle": "How an edge cache serves a page · example",
  "basis": "docs",
  "source": "CDN provider docs and RFC 9111 (HTTP Caching)",
  "summary": "The first visit pays the trip to origin; later ones come from the edge while the TTL holds.",
